  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the capacities of the People&#x2019;s Advocate Office in the Republic of Moldova to work on the human rights to clean, healthy, and sustainable environment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP is committed to supporting national efforts to address the pressing human rights challenges and support the Republic of Moldova to reach its human rights obligations. This intervention aims at laying the foundation for a strategic engagement in the area of human rights implementation that responds to immediate needs and also addresses longer-term aspirations of the Peoples Advocate Office, and will be summarized in the Project document that will be prepared at the end of the Initiation Plan, seeking to enhance the overall human rights landscape in the country. Under this intervention, efforts for strengthening the capacities of the Peoples Advocate Office will be oriented towards empowerment of the rights holders to claim their rights and facilitation of access of rights holders to remedies in case of violation of their rights.</narrative>
  </description>
